# Cloudflare Pages: serve the app for any path it does not have a file for.
#
# Arclis routes in `useState` rather than with a router, so there are no deep
# links to resolve - but a visitor who types or is sent /registry would
# otherwise get Cloudflare's 404 page instead of the site. A 200 rewrite is
# only consulted after static assets fail to match, so this cannot shadow a
# real file.
/*  /index.html  200
